<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Halo</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Welcome to the Neighbourhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0BBuP5Ynwl0hMKbQGEjfnk</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mike Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mike Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Here we are again.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A thick brown belt on my arm again.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A tablespoon full of tar again.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've let go &amp; it never felt so good.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've sold out my friends.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; ruined my life over again.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My energy &amp; my money's spent.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can see your halo fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can see your halo fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause I had it then I lost it all.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cold sweats in the morning.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Real life's become boring.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've tripped &amp; I'm falling.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I'll stop tomorrow.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Can you catch the feeling?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A small wet cloth to stem the bleeding.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The scars on my arms are barely healing.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can see your halo fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can see your halo fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause I had it then I lost it all.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just a quick fix then I'll get clean.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can see your halo fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can see your halo fall.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause I had it then I lost it all.</p></div></body></tt>